Changes made by Udgam Labs: added 714 Devanagari vocabulary pieces and a Hindi language tag; retrained all model
weights on Hindi, English and Hinglish speech (2,732 hours) with quantisation-aware training; exported as shruti.cact.

The model runs in the Cactus needle engine (https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle3), Apache-2.0, which is not
included in this repository.

